  "description": "Cases for the non-author-approval census probe, shared by the TypeScript and Python stack tests. Each case replaces .github/rulesets/main.json in a copy of fixtures/repos/adopter with `ruleset` (an object, or raw JSON text written as is), writes each file in `files` (null deletes it), and expects the probe to be met or not.",
